'''Autumn = Sports Day!''' (秋だよ運動会！, ''Akidayo Undōkai!'', '''Autumn Sports Day!''') is the October event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. The '''Autumn = Sports Day!''' stages were added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Autumn {{=}} Sports Day!'''}} returns to The Battle Cats! Visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} to enter the annual tournament and earn glory for your Cat Army.. but don't let Pigge Back from the rich school across town steal away the gold medal!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available October 1st (11:00am) thru November 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Sports Day Cat'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!)

※ After you have picked up Sports Day Cat, unlock it at the {{Color|#34A853|'''Rare Cats'''}} section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Sports Day Cat from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

